{"school":{"dbn":"31R051","name":"I.S. 051 Edwin Markham","boro":"Staten Island","district":"31","district_label":"District 31","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"Middle","grades":"6 to 8","status":"open","enrollment":1108,"enrollment_year":"2025-26","address":"80 WILLOWBROOK ROAD, STATEN ISLAND, NY 10302","phone":"718-727-8481","website":"www.IS51.org","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/68726","accessibility":"Fully Accessible","overview":"Our school offers students the choice of three different academies based on enrichment themes, Performing Arts (Band, Dance and Drama), Fine Arts (Art, Digital Art and Virtual Enterprise) and Video Robotics.  Students are scheduled for their enrichment class everyday. If their is a problem in making a choice we have a after school program in which we offer a wide variety of clubs and activities that address the interests of all students. We also offer sports in our afterschool program such as Basketball, Baseball, Bowling, Track, Softball, Volleyball, and Soccer. Our academic program is geared to get all our students prepared for high school and beyond. We provide the necessary supports and accelerated opportunities for all our various learners which includes Regents exams in Living Environment, US History, Algebra and the Spanish Proficiency exam. Our school partners with Wagner College to have one of the only Colleges Offices within a Middle School in the city.","start_time":"8:10am","end_time":"2:30pm","languages":null,"subway":null,"bus":"S44, S48, S57, S59, S89, S94, S98, SIM3, SIM30, SIM33, SIM33C, SIM34, SIM35, SIM3C","shared_building":"0","neighborhood":"Meiers Corners","latitude":40.6231,"longitude":-74.1455,"coordinate_source":"points","first_year":"2015-16","last_year":"2025-26"},"series":{"attendance_inperson_k8_all":{"y":["2020-21"],"v":[0.864],"n":[655.0]},"attendance_k8_all":{"y":["2018-19","2019-20","2020-21","2021-22","2022-23","2023-24","2024-25"],"v":[0.9,0.